called "Cold as Ice."

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:06.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.300
♪♪

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.834
-♪ Cold as Ice ♪

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.400
-♪ Cold as ice ♪

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.000
