into something funny?

00:05:12.467 --> 00:05:14.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.067 --> 00:05:18.767
Is it "A," Guffawedify?

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:22.534
"B," Riddikulus?

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:26.100
Or "C," "Prepostumsempra"?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.200
-Guffawedify.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.167
I'm going to say it's "A,"
Guffawedify.

00:05:29.167 --> 00:05:30.167
[ Buzzer ]

00:05:30.167 --> 00:05:32.334
-Incorrect!
-Darn it!

00:05:32.334 --> 00:05:34.501
The correct answer --
-Riddikulus?

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:36.100
-The correct was "Riddikulus."

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.234
-All right, here we go.
-Ice time!

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:41.234
[ Laughs evilly ]

00:05:41.234 --> 00:05:50.133
♪♪

00:05:50.133 --> 00:05:52.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.734
