00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.667
Daniel, you are the winner!
[Bell dinging]

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:06.267
-He overbid!
You overbid!

00:07:06.267 --> 00:07:09.033
-No!
-I'm sorry, Jimmy.

00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:12.167
Time for the ice hose!

00:07:12.167 --> 00:07:15.167
[ Laughs evilly ]

00:07:15.167 --> 00:07:16.901
